sequenceDiagram
    %% Entrepreneur Complete Journey from Login to Business Outcome

    autonumber
    actor Founder as Entrepreneur
    participant Auth as Auth & Onboarding (/onboarding)
    participant Dash as Entrepreneur Dashboard (/dashboard/entrepreneur)
    participant CompSvc as CompanyService (/api/company)
    participant Diligence as Diligence & Data Room
    actor Investor as Accredited Investor
    participant Deals as DealsController (/api/deals)
    participant CapTable as Phase4CapTables

    %% Login & Setup
    Founder->>Auth: Log in & pass Phase 1 Verification
    Auth-->>Dash: Redirect to /dashboard/entrepreneur
    Founder->>CompSvc: POST /api/company (Create Venture Profile)

    %% Venture Progression
    Dash->>CompSvc: Complete Phase 3 (Upload Monthly Traction & KPIs)
    Dash->>CompSvc: Complete Phase 4 (Structure ESOP & Initial Cap Table)
    Dash->>CompSvc: Complete Phase 5 (Calculate €4.5M Valuation via ValuationEngine)
    Dash->>Diligence: Complete Phase 6 (Populate Data Room & Enable Digital NDA)

    %% Investor Diligence & Offer
    Investor->>Diligence: Match with Company & Accept NDA
    Investor->>Diligence: Audit Cap Table & Growth Metrics
    Investor->>Deals: Submit €500,000 Term Sheet (10% Equity)

    %% Negotiation & Close
    Founder->>Deals: Review, Negotiate & Accept Term Sheet
    Investor->>Deals: Sign Investment Agreement
    Founder->>Deals: Countersign Investment Agreement
    Founder->>Deals: POST /api/deals/{id}/close (Confirm Wire Ingress)

    %% Outcome
    Deals->>CompSvc: Update Company.AmountRaised = €500,000 & CurrentPhase = 10
    Deals->>CapTable: Issue Preferred Shares (Append Phase4CapTable Version 2)
    Deals-->>Founder: Business Outcome: Seed Round Closed, Capital Deployed, Venture Scale
